data: {"id": "6ba42a1a154a4fb3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1248", "run_id": "6ba42a1a154a4fb3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 3. 证据整合与根因判断\n\n### 已采集事实汇总\n\n| 证据来源 | 关键事实 | 支持/反驳 ImagePullBackOff 根因 |\n|---------|---------|-------------------------------|\n| **Metrics** | `phase=Pending`, `waiting_reason=ImagePullBackOff`, `restarts=0` | ✅ 确认当前异常状态 |\n| **kubectl describe** | 容器状态 `Waiting / ImagePullBackOff`；事件显示 `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | ✅ 直接确认错误镜像 |\n| **describe 事件原文** | `lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | ✅ **根因：镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid` DNS 解析失败** |\n| **P", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789041572574, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

