alid/aiops/workload:missing` 时遭遇 DNS 解析失败（`no such host`）。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n- 原始 K8s 事件 `Failed to pull image` 明确报告了 `dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` 错误（证据 #3）。\n- 容器状态长期维持在 `ImagePullBackOff`，且重试退避行为符合预期（证据 #2, #4）。\n- 资源配置正常（证据 #6），进一步排除其他启动故障可能。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 9.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-z7kdp: 40.3s (Evidence 35.1s, RCA 5.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- 未调用 Runbook\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 61.234, "metrics": {"run_id": "6ba42a1a154a4fb3", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 61.24118614196777, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "38%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": false, "runbook_id": null, "pass": false, "score": 0.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.045, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "未匹配"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakd